WEBVTT

00:14.420 --> 00:15.170
Aoi-

00:15.170 --> 00:17.130
This is all because you summoned
that monster here!

00:17.130 --> 00:19.080
This is the end of the world!

00:19.080 --> 00:20.580
<b>Sage who summoned Yogiri</b>

00:19.080 --> 00:20.580
<b>and his classmates to this world.</b>

00:19.580 --> 00:20.580
Um...

00:20.580 --> 00:24.290
<b>A Sage assassin.</b>

00:20.580 --> 00:24.290
<b>Was pursuing Yogiri and</b>

00:20.590 --> 00:22.210
The whole world!

00:20.590 --> 00:24.290
<b>Tomochika, but ran away in fear.</b>

00:22.210 --> 00:24.460
I didn't ask to be involved in this!

00:24.460 --> 00:25.750
Damn it.

00:25.750 --> 00:27.580
He isn't human!

00:29.250 --> 00:31.040
Not even a living thing...

00:31.540 --> 00:33.500
She's been like this for a while.

00:33.710 --> 00:36.880
I figured there'd be a change
if you were here, but...

00:36.880 --> 00:40.210
So this is what happened when
she encountered Yogiri Takatou...

00:40.920 --> 00:43.830
Did you learn anything about him?

00:43.830 --> 00:48.040
This is intel I got from the
Sage candidate Daimon Hanakawa...

00:50.040 --> 00:51.670
I'm positive that
if I tell you about Takatou,

00:50.040 --> 00:53.500
<b>(Healer)</b>

00:50.040 --> 00:53.500
<b>Specializes in recovery,</b>

00:50.040 --> 00:53.500
<b>unimposing as an adventurer.</b>

00:51.670 --> 00:53.540
you'll immediately
just kill me afterwards!

00:53.540 --> 00:56.170
Though he looks like a pure
and childlike young man,

00:56.170 --> 00:57.670
but he'll easily kill and then say,

00:57.670 --> 00:58.960
"Oh wow, that's strange!

00:58.960 --> 01:00.500
Didn't know I could kill
someone like this!"

01:00.500 --> 01:03.080
like it's nothing!

01:03.960 --> 01:06.830
You had such a look of desperation
on your face

01:06.830 --> 01:10.790
that you would do anything to survive,
but what happened to that?

01:11.420 --> 01:13.420
You saw that?

01:13.420 --> 01:17.460
I absolutely cannot believe it's possible
to kill someone just by wishing to do so.

01:17.460 --> 01:18.130
But...!

01:18.130 --> 01:19.830
I get it.

01:18.130 --> 01:23.420
<b>Spawn of Dark God Albagarma</b>

01:19.830 --> 01:23.460
Killing that Yogiri Takatou guy
is the priority.

01:23.460 --> 01:24.670
But how?

01:24.670 --> 01:28.080
I can get help from someone
even stronger than Master.

01:28.080 --> 01:29.210
What is that?

01:29.210 --> 01:30.710
The key to the seal.

01:30.710 --> 01:32.210
What are you talking about?

01:32.210 --> 01:34.130
Master's younger sister.

01:34.130 --> 01:36.380
Her acts were overly chaotic,

01:36.380 --> 01:39.130
so when Master had the chance
she was sealed away.

01:39.130 --> 01:40.580
If that sort of person exists,

01:40.580 --> 01:42.290
then I suspect you won't
need me around, farewell!

01:44.330 --> 01:47.670
I don't know this Takatou guy very well.

01:47.670 --> 01:50.040
That's why I have to have you with me.

01:50.040 --> 01:51.000
Er, well,

01:51.000 --> 01:54.880
it would be embarrassing if someone
saw us and thought we were together!

01:54.880 --> 01:57.710
In that case, I can cast
a recognition block.

01:58.500 --> 02:01.250
Please, increase our
friendship level first!

02:01.250 --> 02:02.790
NO!

02:02.790 --> 02:04.380
I mean, what even is this?!

02:04.380 --> 02:06.460
Just as I was used to doing
the bidding of a tomboy,

02:06.460 --> 02:08.380
I'm stuck being a slave to a shota?!

02:08.380 --> 02:09.960
Or is this one of those twists

02:09.960 --> 02:12.130
where you'll say "Actually, I'm a girl!"
or something?!

02:12.130 --> 02:15.080
In that case, I might be
on board with that!

03:46.040 --> 03:50.920
<b>"It's Like a Class Full of People Who Only Want to Save Themselves"</b>

03:46.630 --> 03:49.960
If you can traverse the Underworld
beneath us and defeat the Dark God,

03:49.960 --> 03:52.670
the Sages have said it will be
acknowledged as a great achievement.

03:52.670 --> 03:56.290
Well, I do believe you lot
lack what is necessary to succeed.

03:56.290 --> 03:58.670
But this is also part of our pact
with the Sages.

03:58.670 --> 04:00.880
We'll prepare a base for you.

04:01.330 --> 04:03.380
And know this:

04:03.380 --> 04:06.580
The royal family has the ability
to cause the Gift to weaken.

04:06.580 --> 04:10.960
Your fingers should reattach
once there is distance between us.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.000
What do we do?

04:15.130 --> 04:16.330
Hey!

04:16.710 --> 04:17.710
How is she here?!

04:17.710 --> 04:18.750
Tomochii! You're alive?!

04:18.750 --> 04:19.670
Dannoura! How'd you make it out?
Tomochii! You're alive?!<b></b>

04:19.670 --> 04:20.790
Dannoura-chan!
Dannoura! How'd you make it out?<b>
Tomo-chan!</b>

04:20.790 --> 04:23.750
Someone acknowledge Takatou-kun too!

04:24.130 --> 04:25.750
We were worried about you!

04:25.750 --> 04:26.750
We sure were!

04:35.710 --> 04:38.670
It never used to be this big.

04:41.420 --> 04:43.920
Welcome back, Your Highness.

04:44.130 --> 04:49.210
I am Holaris,
the archbishop of this church.

04:49.210 --> 04:51.920
My first thought was just to go home,

04:51.920 --> 04:53.670
but everything has changed,

04:51.920 --> 04:55.380
<b>Head of the Axis Church.</b>

04:51.920 --> 04:55.380
<b>Kept Dark God Albagarma sealed</b>

04:51.920 --> 04:55.380
<b>for a thousand years.</b>

04:53.670 --> 04:55.420
and I'm unsure of what to do.

04:55.750 --> 04:58.170
I will show you to your home.

04:58.420 --> 05:02.170
We are all overjoyed
at your return, however,

05:02.170 --> 05:06.880
we thought Your Highness was still
suppressing the Dark God in the Canyon.

05:07.040 --> 05:09.130
The Dark God in the canyon is defeated.

05:09.130 --> 05:11.830
Then what about the sealing key?

05:12.000 --> 05:13.330
What is that?

05:13.540 --> 05:16.670
It doesn't seem as if
you are feigning ignorance.

05:25.170 --> 05:29.750
I don't think my decision
to leave you guys behind was wrong.

05:29.750 --> 05:31.500
I don't really care.

05:31.500 --> 05:33.880
To be honest I'm upset,

05:32.630 --> 05:40.170
<b>(General)</b>

05:32.630 --> 05:40.170
<b>Has the leadership ability to rally a large group</b>

05:32.630 --> 05:40.170
<b>of people towards a single goal and act on it.</b>

05:33.880 --> 05:36.710
but complaining at this point
will just irritate me!

05:36.710 --> 05:39.500
Or are you saying it's bad
that we're here?

05:39.500 --> 05:40.210
Well...

05:40.210 --> 05:43.790
Since we have so few allies
in this other world,

05:43.790 --> 05:47.000
shouldn't we be helping each other out?

05:47.170 --> 05:48.040
Who's that?

05:48.040 --> 05:49.330
Sora Akino-san.

05:49.330 --> 05:52.000
<b>(Idol)</b>

05:49.330 --> 05:52.000
<b>Has a skill called "vow" where in exchange for pledging</b>

05:49.330 --> 05:52.000
<b>an oath to her, the other party's abilities are strengthened.</b>

05:49.340 --> 05:52.040
She's a famous idol both at school
and in the entertainment business.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.170
But...

05:53.170 --> 05:55.460
I'm not sure if we can trust them.

05:55.460 --> 05:58.670
That's because if you went
through what they did,

05:58.670 --> 06:03.790
you are the type of person who
would undoubtedly seek revenge, no?

06:03.790 --> 06:06.380
I remember them saying Yazaki
was the leader...

06:06.380 --> 06:08.250
Pretty sure he was.

06:08.670 --> 06:11.500
How's it fair the girls
can move around both floors

06:11.500 --> 06:14.710
when we're banned from the second floor?

06:15.000 --> 06:18.210
Yuugo-kun, he looks like
he doesn't know who we are.

06:18.210 --> 06:20.290
Yeah, who are you guys?

06:20.290 --> 06:26.830
<b>(Cook)</b>

06:20.290 --> 06:26.830
<b>Can make delicious food.</b>

06:20.290 --> 06:26.830
<b>(Reader)</b>

06:20.290 --> 06:26.830
<b>Can understand the script of any language.</b>

06:20.300 --> 06:21.540
Are you serious?!

06:21.540 --> 06:24.750
I talked to you a whole lot!

06:24.750 --> 06:26.880
Since you always looked half-asleep.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.920
We're your fellow class losers,
nice to meetcha.

06:29.920 --> 06:32.580
We don't know if he's a loser yet,
you know.

06:32.580 --> 06:35.130
But Takatou's class is an insect hunter.

06:35.130 --> 06:37.250
You can only kill bugs, right?

06:37.250 --> 06:39.830
Yeah... What are you guys' abilities?

06:37.250 --> 06:39.790
<b>(Insect Hunter)</b>

06:37.250 --> 06:39.790
<b>Causes Instant Death to all insects. (Cover story)</b>

06:39.830 --> 06:41.920
I'm in the Cook class.

06:41.920 --> 06:45.330
I'm a Reader. I can read any kind of book.

06:47.750 --> 06:48.880
Who's that?

06:50.790 --> 06:52.500
Ugh, it's Fukai.

06:52.500 --> 06:53.790
Takatou-kun,

06:52.500 --> 06:55.420
<b>(Death God)</b>

06:52.500 --> 06:55.420
<b>Causes Instant Death to target.</b>

06:53.790 --> 06:55.460
can I talk to you for a second?

06:56.920 --> 06:59.380
And what the hell
do you mean "Eroge Master"?!

06:59.380 --> 07:01.500
Wow, can you lean in any further?

07:01.500 --> 07:02.960
It's a class name.

07:02.960 --> 07:05.040
Eroge Master Shinya Ushio-kun.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.920
<b>(Eroge Master)</b>

07:05.330 --> 07:07.750
Eroge Meister Keiichi Munakata-kun.

07:05.500 --> 07:07.420
<b>(Eroge Meister)</b>

07:07.750 --> 07:10.210
Eroge Maniac Mitsuo Yatate.

07:08.000 --> 07:09.790
<b>(Eroge Maniac)</b>

07:10.210 --> 07:13.580
The three of them together are called the
The Three Eroge Nobles.

07:13.830 --> 07:15.630
<b>The Three Eroge Nobles</b>

07:14.750 --> 07:15.670
And?!

07:15.670 --> 07:20.330
Their abilities seem to be a reflection
of their characters.

07:20.330 --> 07:21.670
What kind of abilites do they have?

07:21.670 --> 07:23.290
Ushio can stop time.

07:23.290 --> 07:25.040
Munakata has X-ray vision.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.380
Yatate has tentacles.

07:26.380 --> 07:27.790
Tentacles?

07:30.380 --> 07:31.710
Dannoura-san.

07:31.710 --> 07:34.460
I want to talk to you about Takatou-kun.

07:35.130 --> 07:36.380
Sure.

07:36.380 --> 07:38.330
What do you want to talk about?

07:39.290 --> 07:40.790
Lord Okakushi.

07:41.420 --> 07:42.880
Who are you?

07:42.880 --> 07:44.330
A Death God...

07:44.330 --> 07:48.830
So there's no reason to leave everything
to you, the "Taker of Souls," anymore.

07:48.960 --> 07:53.540
I know you can't say much,
but why did you come here?

07:53.540 --> 07:54.960
Up to this point...

07:54.960 --> 07:58.830
even though I was told
to keep tabs on you,

07:58.830 --> 08:03.460
I was never allowed to get close
or look you directly in the eye.

08:08.500 --> 08:12.000
This is an eye that can
detect the supernatural.

08:12.210 --> 08:15.880
However, I lost that power
when I got here.

08:17.290 --> 08:19.420
Is that all you wanted to say?

08:19.420 --> 08:23.080
I know you haven't unleashed
your power here.

08:25.540 --> 08:27.750
He really is a freak, huh?

08:28.500 --> 08:29.210
You want this?

08:29.210 --> 08:30.330
Hell no!

08:32.580 --> 08:34.790
Takatou-kun, can we talk?

08:34.790 --> 08:36.750
Uh, sure.

08:36.960 --> 08:39.710
I am truly very sorry!

08:39.710 --> 08:42.290
Come on! You apologize too, Carol!

08:42.290 --> 08:44.460
Why? Why should I?

08:45.000 --> 08:47.210
The first gate is opened!

08:47.210 --> 08:48.790
That means no matter where we are,

08:47.210 --> 08:52.170
<b>(Samurai)</b>

08:47.210 --> 08:52.170
<b>Specializes in the art</b>

08:47.210 --> 08:52.170
<b>of the blade using a katana.</b>

08:48.790 --> 08:52.170
he can kill us instantly
if we get on his bad side!

08:52.380 --> 09:00.130
I wouldn't do that, but the way you
phrased that kind of irritated me.

09:00.130 --> 09:03.710
It's so funny to see Ryouko freaking out
when she's normally so cool and calm!

09:03.710 --> 09:06.330
You two know about me, don't you?

09:06.830 --> 09:07.920
Yup.

09:07.920 --> 09:10.710
I'm from the Agency,
and Ryouko is from the Institute.

09:07.920 --> 09:13.960
<b>(Ninja)</b>

09:07.920 --> 09:13.960
<b>Specializes in covert operations</b>

09:07.920 --> 09:13.960
<b>and combat using ninjutsu.</b>

09:10.710 --> 09:14.000
Fukai-kun, who just left your room,
is from the Cult.

09:14.000 --> 09:17.380
We've been dispatched to keep
an eye on you, Takatou-kun.

09:17.380 --> 09:19.330
I thought I had surveillance on me,

09:19.330 --> 09:21.710
but I never imagined
there'd be three of you.

09:21.710 --> 09:22.790
By the way,

09:22.790 --> 09:26.500
since it was just the two of you who came
here together, did you do the thing yet?

09:26.500 --> 09:27.380
What?!

09:27.380 --> 09:29.710
W-we didn't do anything like that!

09:29.880 --> 09:33.080
Can you tell me about what's going on now?

09:36.540 --> 09:39.830
I wonder what you're doing now,
Big Sister Theo.

09:39.830 --> 09:43.250
<b>Former bodyguard of Yuuki Tachibana.</b>

09:39.830 --> 09:43.250
<b>Now a follower of Lain the Sage</b>

09:39.840 --> 09:43.250
<b>via sucking her blood.</b>

09:40.630 --> 09:42.500
I've been searching for you forever!

09:43.290 --> 09:44.880
And you're the last!

09:44.880 --> 09:48.250
I will become the heir
to the Origin Bloods.

09:49.580 --> 09:51.000
Please, stop!

09:59.920 --> 10:00.960
Are these...

10:02.500 --> 10:05.000
Lain-sama's memories?

10:05.580 --> 10:09.170
In other words, Akino-san
uses her skill called "vow"

10:09.170 --> 10:12.540
and the classmates she uses them on
aren't allowed to use their Gifts, right?

10:12.540 --> 10:16.670
As long as they weren't stopping time,
it wasn't a big deal.

10:16.830 --> 10:20.250
But we didn't know whether or not
X-ray vision was being used.

10:20.420 --> 10:23.330
I sure don't want to be in the same place
as a guy like that.

10:23.330 --> 10:28.790
And Yazaki-kun couldn't get us together,
so Akino-san became the leader.

10:28.790 --> 10:31.290
If you break the vow,
do you die or something?

10:31.290 --> 10:32.170
Bingo!

10:32.170 --> 10:35.880
Why did you two meet up with us?

10:35.880 --> 10:39.130
I wanted to talk to that
Sion the Sage person.

10:39.130 --> 10:41.960
I thought she might know something
about how to get home.

10:41.960 --> 10:44.380
Ah, I guess going home
would be the normal thing to do.

10:44.380 --> 10:45.580
Oh, yeah.

10:45.580 --> 10:48.630
I thought that we had no other choice
but to become a Sage.

10:48.630 --> 10:52.460
Say, you think we could find a way home
with everyone else's help?

10:52.710 --> 10:53.920
Let's not.

10:53.920 --> 10:56.830
Right now, the only choice we all have
is to accomplish a great achievement.

10:56.830 --> 10:58.210
It's just going to cause chaos.

10:58.500 --> 11:02.540
For now, we can consider ourselves
on the same side, right?

11:02.540 --> 11:04.710
I thought we already were!

11:04.710 --> 11:06.960
I'll do anything you need!

11:20.290 --> 11:23.080
That doesn't look like it's from
a parallel world at ALL!

11:23.080 --> 11:26.420
It's almost the exact same outfit
you wore at your concert.

11:26.420 --> 11:29.040
Even so, this has a decent defense value.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.330
What are you wearing, Carol?

11:30.330 --> 11:31.960
I'm a ninja!

11:31.960 --> 11:34.670
Where's the stealth?!
You stand out like a sore thumb!

11:35.330 --> 11:36.500
I apologize.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.580
I hope you don't think I'm here

11:38.580 --> 11:42.130
to goof off by wearing
a stupid outfit like this...

11:42.130 --> 11:46.080
My outfit probably makes it seem like
I'm goofing off the most.

11:42.130 --> 11:46.040
<b>(Cheerleader)</b>

11:42.130 --> 11:46.040
<b>Raises others' abilities</b>

11:42.130 --> 11:46.040
<b>with cheers.</b>

11:46.080 --> 11:48.170
How did you all get these outfits?

11:48.170 --> 11:51.000
Runa Harufuji the Dressmaker made these.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.750
It's her specialty after all.

11:52.750 --> 11:53.880
Tomochika,

11:53.880 --> 11:56.460
you're all fired up
and getting ready on your own, huh?

11:53.880 --> 12:00.290
<b>(Self-centered Blacksmith)</b>

11:53.880 --> 12:00.290
<b>Can create weapons and protective gear</b>

11:53.880 --> 12:00.290
<b>for her own personal use. (Cover story)</b>

11:56.460 --> 12:00.330
Well, I don't look like this
because I want to do either, you know.

12:00.330 --> 12:05.290
Is that the ability of your class,
the Self-centered Blacksmith?

12:05.290 --> 12:07.170
Are you talking about me?

12:07.170 --> 12:10.830
It's like a class full of people who
only want to save themselves, huh?

12:10.830 --> 12:12.710
That makes us look so bad!

12:13.040 --> 12:15.290
I see the guide has arrived.

12:15.290 --> 12:18.710
<b>Passed the tower trials. Now a Swordmaster</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:18.710
<b>who inherited Urabe's power.</b>

12:16.080 --> 12:18.750
Good to see you again, Dannoura-san.

12:18.750 --> 12:20.460
Rick-san?!

12:20.750 --> 12:22.920
Why are you here, David-san?

12:22.920 --> 12:25.380
The royal family has the ability
to seal things.

12:22.920 --> 12:28.880
<b>Vice Captain of the royal capital guard at the</b>

12:22.920 --> 12:28.880
<b>castle gates. Member of the royal family who</b>

12:22.920 --> 12:28.880
<b>protects the capital with an ability to weaken skills.</b>

12:25.380 --> 12:28.880
My power can completely suppress
a demonic creature of a low rank.

12:28.880 --> 12:34.790
<b>(Consultant)</b>

12:28.880 --> 12:34.790
<b>Analyzes skills and gives</b>

12:28.880 --> 12:34.790
<b>counsel for problem resolution.</b>

12:29.040 --> 12:32.380
We also want to measure our capabilities,

12:32.380 --> 12:34.830
so is it possible for you
to suppress our power too?

12:34.830 --> 12:35.830
Of course.

12:35.830 --> 12:36.960
If that's the case,

12:36.960 --> 12:39.960
then perhaps I should guide you
to where the demonic creatures are.

12:47.210 --> 12:50.580
Looks like there was no reason
for me to be here.

12:50.960 --> 12:54.380
Rick-san, I didn't realize you were
the prince of the Kingdom of Manii.

12:55.710 --> 12:57.500
Actually, I am.

12:57.500 --> 13:00.580
Apologies for interrupting
your little chit-chat,

13:00.580 --> 13:03.080
but are you ready to go, Dannoura-san?

13:03.080 --> 13:05.080
Are you, Akino-san?

13:05.080 --> 13:08.000
Seems like it'll be a cinch with
Ninomiya-san and Carol,

13:08.000 --> 13:10.540
so I may not even need to fight.

13:11.250 --> 13:14.210
Will physical martial arts attacks
work on this thing?

13:14.210 --> 13:16.790
Since it has a human form,
there should be no problem!

13:16.790 --> 13:17.630
Right!

13:20.380 --> 13:21.420
I need something heavy!

13:21.420 --> 13:22.330
You got it!

13:25.790 --> 13:26.670
Now something long!

13:29.920 --> 13:30.500
Wow!

13:30.500 --> 13:31.500
She's strong...

13:34.750 --> 13:36.790
Avoid the line of murderous intent...

13:37.130 --> 13:40.960
Put the end of the sword
along that line and wait.

13:41.380 --> 13:43.880
The enemy will stab themselves.

13:44.290 --> 13:46.040
I'll keep doing this...

13:47.080 --> 13:48.500
and finish them off!

13:48.500 --> 13:50.500
Not too bad, I think.

13:50.500 --> 13:55.330
With moves like those, I wouldn't mind
having you in my battle formation.

13:55.330 --> 13:56.960
How do you do that?!

13:56.960 --> 14:00.330
You move like an amateur
but easily avoid the enemy attacks,

14:00.330 --> 14:02.710
and manage to hit them with the sword
and deal a fatal blow?!

14:03.040 --> 14:06.000
Don't you wanna see my bug-killing power?

14:06.000 --> 14:07.420
That isn't necessary.

14:08.630 --> 14:10.380
No!

14:10.380 --> 14:12.830
This isn't what I want!

14:12.830 --> 14:15.040
What's wrong? Don't you like women?

14:15.040 --> 14:18.630
You can't just crossdress
and think everything is okay!

14:18.630 --> 14:20.290
If you want to pretend to be a femboy,

14:20.290 --> 14:22.880
then you must start from the ground up
with your personality!

14:22.880 --> 14:23.880
Hmph.

14:24.420 --> 14:26.460
What a huge crowd.

14:26.460 --> 14:28.330
Is there a festival or something?

14:29.420 --> 14:31.920
You're like a country bumpkin
that doesn't know a thing!

14:31.920 --> 14:34.380
Ever since you learned
that you wouldn't be killed

14:34.380 --> 14:36.420
you've been getting too carried away...

14:37.210 --> 14:41.630
The younger sister we seek
is under the ground near here,

14:41.880 --> 14:44.830
but since I don't know where
the entrance to the Underworld is,

14:44.830 --> 14:47.080
I suppose we'll gather intel first.

14:47.080 --> 14:51.040
In that case, the tavern
is the place to go!

14:52.750 --> 14:54.000
Now at last...

14:54.500 --> 14:56.380
I am Origin Blood's...

14:56.380 --> 14:58.380
Wait! C'mon, wait!

15:00.960 --> 15:02.040
Stop.

15:04.420 --> 15:06.080
Thank you!

15:06.080 --> 15:09.170
This horse just won't listen
to a word I say...

15:11.580 --> 15:12.460
Huh?

15:12.460 --> 15:14.580
I'm Euphemia.

15:14.580 --> 15:16.920
I... um...

15:16.920 --> 15:17.880
Oh!

15:17.880 --> 15:20.250
Now that I think of it,
I don't have a name!

15:20.250 --> 15:22.250
Hm, what should I pick?

15:22.250 --> 15:23.960
I'll think up something random...

15:23.960 --> 15:24.830
Is this...

15:25.000 --> 15:26.210
Risley!

15:26.210 --> 15:28.540
My name will be Risley!

15:30.000 --> 15:32.960
This is my first time at a tavern...

15:32.960 --> 15:35.420
so how are we supposed to get intel?

15:35.420 --> 15:38.750
How about we eavesdrop
on the conversations around us?

15:40.250 --> 15:42.130
You were so confident
when you said to come here

15:42.130 --> 15:44.830
I thought you'd have a decent idea.

15:44.830 --> 15:46.170
Hello, Miss.

15:46.460 --> 15:48.420
Is there a festival today?

15:48.420 --> 15:50.460
There sure is!

15:50.460 --> 15:52.920
Apparently, the Sage candidates
have already reached

15:52.920 --> 15:54.790
the fifth level of the Underworld

15:54.790 --> 15:56.920
only a few days
after starting their conquest,

15:56.920 --> 15:58.710
so everybody's celebrating!

15:58.710 --> 16:00.000
Are you serious?!

16:00.000 --> 16:00.880
Hm?!

16:02.000 --> 16:02.880
What's wrong?

16:02.880 --> 16:05.380
It'd be bad if those guys found us!

16:05.380 --> 16:07.000
Can't we do something about this?

16:07.000 --> 16:08.580
Let me think...

16:10.380 --> 16:14.330
I used a recognition blocker
so that they won't notice us.

16:15.460 --> 16:18.420
If we won't be noticed,
then we can draw a little closer...

16:20.130 --> 16:22.420
What's the Takatou loser's problem?!

16:22.420 --> 16:24.080
He just popped up halfway through,

16:24.080 --> 16:27.000
snatched up all the beautiful girls,
and freakin' left!

16:27.000 --> 16:29.420
I envy him every single night!

16:29.420 --> 16:33.710
Even though we've done way more than him,
why aren't we getting more attention?!

16:33.710 --> 16:36.630
Maybe 'cause we're called the
The Three Eroge Nobles.

16:36.630 --> 16:37.880
Evening.

16:37.880 --> 16:40.580
You all are Sage candidates, right?

16:40.580 --> 16:43.630
Oh hey, maybe Heroes DO get attention!

16:43.630 --> 16:44.830
Sure do!

16:44.830 --> 16:46.040
Huh? But...

16:46.040 --> 16:48.460
<b>Using ability on classmates</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:48.460
<b>goes against the vow.</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:48.460
<b>Will you proceed?</b>

16:50.210 --> 16:51.460
Ayaka Shinozaki!

16:52.460 --> 16:53.670
I've caught you.

16:54.880 --> 16:55.830
Ushio?!

16:55.830 --> 16:57.460
What, are we fightin'?!

16:57.460 --> 16:58.630
Yeah, get 'im!

16:58.790 --> 17:01.420
Stop it!

17:05.000 --> 17:06.170
Why are you doing this?!

17:06.330 --> 17:08.630
For revenge, isn't it obvious?

17:08.630 --> 17:10.670
Ushio! Stop that woman!

17:20.580 --> 17:22.500
Now then, Munakata-kun?

17:22.500 --> 17:23.540
Y-yes?

17:23.540 --> 17:27.250
From today forward,
I'm going to kill one of you each day.

17:27.380 --> 17:29.960
Enjoy shaking in your boots
while you can, okay?

17:30.130 --> 17:34.290
Let everyone in the class know.
Can you do that for me?

17:36.710 --> 17:39.420
I'm going to do that
until there's no one left.

17:41.330 --> 17:42.920
That's Ayaka-tan...

17:43.290 --> 17:48.830
From what I saw earlier, she was
extremely upset at being left behind!

17:49.500 --> 17:52.790
If that's the case,
then I may also be a target of hers!

17:55.290 --> 17:57.330
Did something happen?

17:57.880 --> 18:01.040
What? I guess my
recognition blocker isn't working.

18:01.040 --> 18:02.250
Good evening.

18:02.250 --> 18:04.380
You're Hanakawa-san, correct?

18:04.380 --> 18:07.040
I am Sion the Sage.

18:07.040 --> 18:08.750
Do you remember me?

18:08.750 --> 18:09.710
Yes!

18:09.710 --> 18:12.880
Well, I shall take me leave now, indeed!

18:12.880 --> 18:13.880
To where?

18:13.880 --> 18:15.670
We are researching the Underworld,

18:15.670 --> 18:19.960
so I thought we'd go around to
another shop and listen in some more...

18:19.960 --> 18:23.040
Then I will tell you all about it.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.830
Give up on escaping.

18:25.830 --> 18:29.290
Nothing good will come
out of offending her.

18:29.290 --> 18:33.500
I'd like to ask you
about Yogiri Takatou-san.

18:33.830 --> 18:35.210
Gulp...

18:35.790 --> 18:39.290
This is the first I've heard of him having
the ability to sense murderous intent.

18:39.290 --> 18:41.460
What will you do with Yogiri Takatou?

18:41.460 --> 18:46.290
I think immediately disposing of him
is best to prevent trouble in the future,

18:46.290 --> 18:49.380
but I also think I'd be able
to make use of him in many ways.

18:49.380 --> 18:51.630
I'll take care of Yogiri Takatou.

18:51.630 --> 18:53.250
I can't imagine what someone like

18:53.250 --> 18:55.750
the Dark Lord's underling
can possibly do, though.

18:55.750 --> 18:56.830
Come again?!

18:56.830 --> 18:57.880
If you intend to fight,

18:57.880 --> 18:59.920
please do it in a place
where I won't get caught in any-

18:59.920 --> 19:01.830
Wha-?! Why's that hand facing me?!

19:01.830 --> 19:04.710
You're no longer of any use to me,
Hanakawa-san.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.630
What's the big idea?!

19:10.630 --> 19:12.040
Well that's interesting.

19:12.040 --> 19:15.290
My heat ray transformed
into whipped cream.

19:15.290 --> 19:17.000
I beg you, please wait a moment!

19:17.000 --> 19:20.420
You said you'd tell us more
about the Underworld, right?

19:20.420 --> 19:23.000
Yes, I completely forgot!

19:23.000 --> 19:25.000
What would you like to know?

19:25.000 --> 19:27.960
Where might the entrance
to the Underworld be?

19:27.960 --> 19:32.630
If you mean in this city, then you can
frequently catch sight of the entrance.

19:32.630 --> 19:35.830
Try purchasing a ticket from the tavern.

19:35.830 --> 19:37.210
What?!

19:37.210 --> 19:37.920
Oh!

19:37.920 --> 19:39.880
I may just be swinging at
the hornet's nest,

19:39.880 --> 19:41.880
but are you done with me now?

19:41.880 --> 19:44.250
I took the time to tell you about the
Underworld,

19:44.250 --> 19:46.210
so if I killed you now...

19:46.210 --> 19:48.330
that would be a waste.

19:49.830 --> 19:51.580
That lady's crazy.

19:51.580 --> 19:54.250
I have no idea what she's thinking.

19:55.040 --> 19:59.960
Who could possibly want to see someone
like me just dripping in whipped cream?

20:00.460 --> 20:03.710
Takatou-kun, what are you doing
during the day?

20:03.710 --> 20:07.420
Hm? Gaming, reading books...

20:07.420 --> 20:11.130
Ugh, and I'm out there slaying and
slaughtering magical creatures...

20:11.130 --> 20:14.000
So, how is the Underworld invasion going?

20:14.000 --> 20:16.500
Right now, we've reached
the edge of the fifth level,

20:16.500 --> 20:18.210
so I guess we'll start with
the sixth tomorrow.

20:18.210 --> 20:20.500
There's a Dark God
on the seventh level, you know?

20:20.500 --> 20:22.420
You think it'll be this easy?

20:22.420 --> 20:25.460
We're barely gonna make
the one month deadline!

20:25.460 --> 20:30.540
Even if we fail, if that Sion person
is gonna show up, then it's fine.

20:30.540 --> 20:33.380
And what about the deaths
of those eroge guys?

20:33.380 --> 20:36.000
It seems Ushio-san was killed.

20:36.000 --> 20:38.880
Munakata-san says Shinozaki-san did it.

20:38.880 --> 20:43.330
She swore she'd kill us
one by one for revenge.

20:43.330 --> 20:46.290
But Shinozaki-san was dead, wasn't she?

20:46.540 --> 20:47.750
Yeah, she was.

20:49.130 --> 20:52.250
The Sage candidates have arrived
at the sixth level of the Underworld.

20:52.250 --> 20:56.670
At this rate, it's only a matter of time
before they reach the seventh.

20:56.670 --> 20:58.880
Since it's far too easy for them,

20:58.880 --> 21:01.000
let's throw a little wrench
in their plans.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.920
Well, defeating the Dark God

21:01.000 --> 21:04.920
<b>Sion the Sage's</b>

21:01.000 --> 21:04.920
<b>attendent and confidant.</b>

21:02.920 --> 21:04.960
should not at all be as simple.

21:05.170 --> 21:07.670
And what will we do about Yogiri Takatou?

21:07.670 --> 21:10.040
I haven't made up my mind yet.

21:11.500 --> 21:12.710
What in the world is that?

21:12.710 --> 21:15.420
A door-to-door transporter.

21:16.670 --> 21:17.880
Please, pardon my intrusion.

21:18.210 --> 21:20.830
You're the Sage candidate, Haruto Ootori.

21:20.830 --> 21:22.960
How did you know about this place?

21:22.960 --> 21:25.540
I gave my problem-solving skill a try.

21:25.540 --> 21:26.830
Oh, of course...

21:26.830 --> 21:29.380
And why are you here?

21:29.380 --> 21:31.130
We don't have enough time.

21:31.130 --> 21:35.210
I'm asking if we can get an extension
on the time limit.

21:35.210 --> 21:37.960
The time limit is meant to encourage you,

21:37.960 --> 21:40.670
so as long as everyone is
giving their best,

21:40.670 --> 21:42.830
I don't see any problem with that.

21:43.290 --> 21:45.460
I appreciate that... Pardon me.

21:45.460 --> 21:46.790
However...

21:47.000 --> 21:51.210
There's no fun in extending
the deadline for free.

21:52.580 --> 21:54.460
So here's the deal:

21:54.460 --> 21:58.460
Could you get rid of
Yogiri Takatou-san for me?

21:59.080 --> 22:01.420
Get rid of Takatou?

23:36.790 --> 23:40.960
<b>"A Woman from the Past Appeared. Tomochika is Shocked to Her Core..."</b>

23:37.210 --> 23:40.880
"A Woman from the Past Appeared.
Tomochika is Shocked to Her Core..."
